<title>BELGIUM: Closer links with another airline possible - Virgin.</title>
<headline>Closer links with another airline possible - Virgin.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virgin Atlantic Airways chairman Richard Branson said on Tuesday he was not ruling out a closer &quot;relationship&quot; with another airline.</p>
<p>&quot;What we won't be doing is forming an alliance which gives us a monopolistic dominance,&quot; Branson told Reuters at the official launch of the new Brussels-Copenhagen link for his low-cost regional airline Virgin Express.</p>
<p>&quot;Having said that, we may well have relationships with other airlines in the future,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Bert Lauwers, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
